@prefix eco: <https://ggen.dev/ecosystem#> . @prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> . eco:RefusedVerification a skos:Concept; skos:inScheme eco:VerificationEvidenceScheme; skos:prefLabel "Refused Verification"; skos:definition "Verification standing for an edge lawfully refused by an explicit typed guard or policy." .